{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103103","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103103/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103103/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103103/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103103","id":2867629343,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6q7I0f","number":103103,"title":"String function `rstrip` does not strip strings properly","user":{"login":"Barkerprooks","id":18539182,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTM5MTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18539182?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Barkerprooks","html_url":"https://github.com/Barkerprooks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Barkerprooks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Barkerprooks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Barkerprooks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Barkerprooks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Barkerprooks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Barkerprooks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Barkerprooks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Barkerprooks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Barkerprooks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-21T00:56:31Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T01:36:01Z","closed_at":"2025-02-21T01:35:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n\n- Reproducable in 4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono unknown - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Mon, 17 Feb 2025 17:42:11 +0000 - Wayland - GLES3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 7800 XT (radeonsi, navi32, LLVM 19.1.7, DRM 3.60, 6.13.3-arch1-1) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X 16-Core Processor (32 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe GDScript string function `rstrip` does not properly strip strings from the right side when the desired string ends in a character that is included in the undesired string.\n\nExample:\n`\"foobars.json\".rstrip(\".json\")` results in the string `\"foobar\"` when it should be `\"foobars\"`\n\nProof:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9a802f9e-b223-4489-b397-961c98cdeff8)\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a string, create a new string using the `rstring` function supplying an ending where at least one character matches the end of the desired string. Print the second string to the console.\n\nOr use this example:\n```gdscript\nvar string = \"helloworlds.json\"\nvar name = string.rstrip(\".json\")\nprint(name) # outputs \"helloworld\" but we wanted \"helloworlds\"\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18897105/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103103/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103103/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}